flowchart TD
  UP[Creator upload<br/>resumable, presigned] --> RAW[(Raw video<br/>object storage)]
  RAW --> SPLIT[Split into GOP-aligned pieces]
  SPLIT --> ENC[Parallel encoders<br/>each piece × each rung of the ladder]
  ENC --> PKG[Package<br/>CMAF segments + HLS/DASH manifests · DRM]
  PKG --> OUT[(Encoded segments<br/>object storage)]
  OUT --> CDN[CDN edges]
  CDN --> PL[Player<br/>adaptive bitrate]
  ENC --> TH[Thumbnails · captions · content checks]
  PL -. playback events .-> AN[(View counts · QoE metrics)]
